   "about": "The memorandum lists proposed provisions and unresolved policy questions for a Japanese peace settlement.",
   "summary": "Sets out positions on property claims, an end to further reparations removals, industrial capacity, and territorial dispositions. It considers political, economic, and security provisions, including bases, trusteeship, inspection, and withdrawal of occupation forces. It also covers war-related obligations, renewed diplomatic relations, and support for Japan’s admission to the United Nations.",
